-compulsive and posttraumatic stress disorders</article-title><source>World J Biol Psychiatry</source><year>2002</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>171</fpage><lpage>99</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12516310</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barbey</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><name><surname>Roose</surname><given-names>SP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>SSRI safety in overdose</article-title><source>J Clin Psychiatry</source><year>1998</year><volume>59</volume><issue>Suppl 15</issue><fpage>42</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9786310</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barlow</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name><name><surname>Gorman</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Shear</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Cognitive-behavioural therapy, imipramine, or their combination for panic disorder: a randomized controlled trial</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2000</year><volume>283</volume><fpage>2529</fpage><lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10815116</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Berard</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramos</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rey</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>First trimester exposure to paroxetina and risk of cardiac malformations in infants: the importance of dosage</article-title><source>Birth Defects Res B Dev Reprod Toxicol</source><year>2006</year><volume>80</volume><fpage>18</fpage><lpage>27</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17187388</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17"><citation citation-type="journal"><